ON THE NUMBERS IN THIS PROJECT

Please read this before quoting anything from here.

Every figure is labelled MEASURED, COMPUTED or ESTIMATED, in the same sentence as
the number, and a rate carries its denominator and its conditions. Where a
document says MEASURED it means the wall clock or the verdict was actually
observed on the machine and at the fingerprints named beside it; re-derive any of
them with `cargo test --manifest-path native/Cargo.toml` and the harnesses in
native/argmind-measure/. The captured screens, the goal sets and every recorded
answer are in measure/.

Treat a flattering figure with suspicion, including the ones here. Four
conclusions were withdrawn during the two days that built this agent, three of
them flattering, and a previous project on this repository accumulated seventeen
modelling errors of which most favoured the design. If you find a figure missing
its denominator, its conditions or its evidence class, that is a bug — please
report it.

